    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000,
    "bgEffectTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……方向性を考える話し合いなんだが\r\n３人に任せてみてもいいか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 4001077050030,
    "speaker": "甜花",
    "text": "プロデューサーさん……\r\n他のお仕事、いっぱい……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "tenka",
    "textCtrl": "p",
